      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The voice now moves up/down with the head, but it isn't moving forward or to the side at all. If you lean forward, your voice will be coming from behind your head. Not fixed and not \"rare\", it's easy to reproduce this way.",
      "viewerReactions": null
