  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-06T04:45:03.613Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In build 791, the apparent position of a user's voice when speaking fails to track their head position, instead it seems to come from a point a little beneath their nametag. I only experienced this bug from a user using FBT (and me also using FBT, they experienced the same bug with my voice). it may still work using 3-point tracking. Voice still follows in the XZ plane, just not vertically.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Find somebody using FBT.\n2. Ask them to crouch or lay down, or use playspace mover to move vertically up or down.\n\nExpected:\nTheir voice sounds like it comes from their avatar's head position.\n\nActual:\nTheir voice comes from their head position as if they were standing upright regardless of where their avatar's head is.",
